{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113231","id":3050678420,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc611aiU","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113231","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113231.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113231.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113231","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113231/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113231/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113231/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5c90772f8ce8e993cb09ced88b9058d05240bc33","number":113231,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Update Box-Capsule collisions to be more analytical (And optimized?)","user":{"login":"SourceOfHTML","id":70210240,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMjEwMjQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70210240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SourceOfHTML","html_url":"https://github.com/SourceOfHTML","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SourceOfHTML/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SourceOfHTML/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SourceOfHTML/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SourceOfHTML/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SourceOfHTML/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SourceOfHTML/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SourceOfHTML/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SourceOfHTML/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SourceOfHTML/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Previously, _collision_box_capsule made use of the SeparatorAxisTest class and checked things somewhat manually. I've changed it to be more analytical, similar to the helper functions that _collision_sphere_sphere and a few others use.\r\n\r\nI tested the speed with v4.6.dev.custom_build [4601c07d8] (I am willing to test on newer versions if necessary, but `perf record` takes upwards of 40 minutes per run-through), using a 3D scene with a WorldBoundary3D at the bottom, spawning 300-400 RigidBody3D's (_almost_ Half of them Capsules, _almost_ Half Cubes) high above the ground, letting them fall, which exits after 4 seconds, and the results are:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1874\" height=\"971\" alt=\"Light-Mode Hotspot showing the results, on the left is my implementation, on the right is master branch's\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/89bbc377-4ed0-42ee-b1f6-27029f297453\" />\r\n\r\nOn the left is my re-implementation, which is essentially a direct copy-and-mix of _collision_sphere_capsule and _collision_sphere_box, and on the right is the base implementation.\r\n\r\nThe percentages at the bottom of the Flame Graph show that mine has less aggregate cycle costs, so I'm assuming it's faster overall, but I may be incorrect.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time.\r\n\r\nP.S. If there is more data needed to assess, I am happy to provide.\r\n\r\nP.P.S. The test project is [perf_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23819654/perf_test.zip) (Note: I have made a logic error in the condition for choosing whether to spawn a cube or capsule. Whether you fix it to be actually half-half, or leave it be so that it can be compared to my own tests is up to you :))","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues"